  spi loop             Requires MOSI-MISO test jumper

LTE / MQTT
  lte hello            Auto pulse once, AT reply, LED setup
  lte on               Explicit power pulse (alias: pulse)
  lte leds|test|scan    LED modes / status / operator scan
  lte connect          Register/open APN data session
  lte ping [1.1.1.1]   LTE data + real internet echo reply
  lte register [auto|att]    lte credentials|pins
  mqtt test            Read mqtt_creds.json, save/send/readback
  device name Jolteon  device instance 1
  lte bridge           Raw AT console; Ctrl+] exits
  AT...                One modem command; lte quiet releases UART
  Attach LTE antenna before RF/network tests.

